Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.93,0:00:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll go see a movie. Kugisaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:15.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too early to see a movie for me.
