Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.85,0:01:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's actually a love story!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.27,0:01:35.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't want to see some\Nworm-o-man doing anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a human earthworm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.27,0:01:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever, it doesn't matter. Have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going shopping for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.19,0:01:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to come with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.17,0:01:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just spent five minutes telling\Nyou I'm going to the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.75,0:01:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. Later, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.45,0:02:00.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special Grade is a rank reserved for those
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorcerers who display\Nexceptional abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.41,0:02:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my opinion,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.03,0:02:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First Grade is the true\Nrank for the sorcerers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who will lead other sorcerers\Nand jujutsu society.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They must stand above comparison to\Nsemi-first grades in terms of peril,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.23,0:02:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,secrecy, and salary.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.11,0:02:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now with that in mind, what\Nare your recommendations?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.69,0:02:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maki Zenin, Panda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.67,0:02:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Megumi Fushiguro, Nobara Kugisaki, and of\Ncourse there's my brother, Yuji Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.45,0:02:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will swear it on my name as Aoi Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.33,0:02:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And on my name as Meimei.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.83,0:02:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recommend those five\Nfor first grade sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.57,0:02:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who are recommended by at least two
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.05,0:02:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,first-grade sorcerers\Nmust carry out missions,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.39,0:02:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all under the supervision\Nof an active first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-grade or first-grade equivalent sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, if they are deemed fit, they will\Nbe promoted to semi-first-grade sorcerer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and proceed to be assigned\Nfirst-grade missions on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.11,0:03:04.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Following the results of those missions,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.33,0:03:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they either will or won't officially\Nbecome first-grade sorcerers.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.93,0:03:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother will accept the\Nrecommendation to first class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.87,0:03:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Sukuna still uncooperative!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.25,0:03:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll need to go on a lot\Nmore dangerous missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.59,0:03:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In order for him to raise the\Nchances of finding more fingers?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You understand what that means, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.63,0:03:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.54,0:03:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.77,0:03:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What that means is it's going\Nto mean everything to them
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Todo
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.51,0:03:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bright future.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It means a bright future is\Ncoming where the brothers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aoi Toto and Yuji Itadori\Nface missions together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.01,0:03:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bright future lies ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.51,0:03:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no guarantee I'll be the\None assigned to accompany you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you wanted to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm quite certain this will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.59,0:04:06.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as certain as ripe red\Napples falling from a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.53,0:04:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of us are drawn together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.97,0:04:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it truly is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.95,0:04:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:16.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.31,0:04:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the sorcerers who\Nrecommended him for first
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,class can't be assigned to accompany him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.63,0:04:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we were the two first\Nclass who recommended Itadori,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.27,0:04:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone else will have to accompany\Nhim on any of his upcoming missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.77,0:04:32.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.15,0:04:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to be going now, Mr. Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.61,0:04:55.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were with Itadori\Nearlier, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come again?
