Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.87,0:06:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I guess I've grown about\N15 centimeters since graduation day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.41,0:06:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I guess,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.32,0:06:52.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the combination of the stress of moving\Nto Tokyo and changing environments.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.39,0:06:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a real Kuroko City.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On graduation day, I worked up the courage\Nto ask if he'd take a photo with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:06.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, what I wanted was\Nto ask for his phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I already knew that\Nwe were moving to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.77,0:07:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when I saw Itadori with you earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.23,0:07:16.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought maybe with the\Nway I look now, I might...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:20.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Yuko, you mean that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.35,0:07:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it's like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.57,0:07:24.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's what I mean, it's like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.41,0:07:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up, Ijichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is Fushiguro still riding with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just dropped you a location\Npin to the restaurant I'm at.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.31,0:07:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you turn around and bring him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:36.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.57,0:07:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who knows Itadori pretty\Nwell is on his way here right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.25,0:07:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we should talk\Nto him about it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you're also interested\Nin Itadori, then... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If hell throws over and\Ndance the lombata...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.09,0:07:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still no.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:07:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.63,0:08:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got the weirdest\Nfeeling in my chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.19,0:08:07.65,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\pos(454.667,70)\c&H391D6D&\bord0\shad0\fnComic Sans MS}Did my heart\Nskip a beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.39,0:08:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did my heart skip a beat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, what's the big emergency?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey there, Fushiguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.99,0:08:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does Itadori have a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Yuko Ozawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She knows Itadori from middle\Nschool, if you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.65,0:08:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so it's like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, totally like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.93,0:08:26.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He definitely doesn't have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.45,0:08:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he had to transfer to Tokyo, he\Ndidn't seem particularly upset about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.33,0:08:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He also has a pin-up\Nposter hanging in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.63,0:08:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone with a girlfriend wouldn't\Nhave something like that hanging up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.39,0:08:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because she would hate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you the type to\Ndrink coffee black only
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.57,0:08:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when women are around so you can show off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.63,0:08:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.67,0:08:47.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you call me here to ask me\Nabout this or to ridicule me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.43,0:08:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I always drink it black, so there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.85,0:08:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you happen\Nto know what his type is?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.11,0:08:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he might have mentioned\Nthat he likes tall girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a real shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll text Itadori now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.39,0:09:06.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay with that, Yuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.47,0:09:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.61,0:09:12.08,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\pos(314.667,16.667)\an8\fs14\shad0\3c&H6B727F&\c&HDAE9F9&}Yuji Itadori
Dialogue: 1,0:09:07.82,0:09:12.08,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\pos(377.333,121.333)\an8\fs10\shad0\3c&HF9BCA8&}Hey.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.04,0:09:12.08,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs10\shad0\c&H9E9CE4&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(380.667,187.333)}FAMILY Restaurant
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.24,0:09:12.08,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs10\shad0\3c&HF9BCA8&\pos(377.333,246.667)}Come.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.32,0:09:12.08,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs10\shad0\c&HA5A79D&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(253.333,275)}Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.66,0:09:12.08,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs10\shad0\3c&HF9BCA8&\pos(376,310)}Come.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.45,0:09:12.08,Sign_Basic,Phone,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs10\shad0\c&HA5A79D&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(254,338)}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.21,0:09:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That felt kinda curt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.85,0:09:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro's here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.87,0:09:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was fast
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.73,0:09:23.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh... Crap.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:23.46,0:09:24.17,Main,Fushiguro,0,0,0,,{\an8}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.61,0:09:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.52,0:09:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell Isidori about Yuko.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.99,0:09:28.03,Main,Yuji,0,0,0,,{\an8}Finding a money exchange was a pain, \Nso I traded in for prizes instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I traded in for prizes instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.55,0:09:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He definitely won't recognize\Nher after she changed so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.93,0:09:33.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.77,0:09:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the number one line you\Ndon't want to hear when reuniting
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.41,0:09:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the guy from middle\Nschool who you liked like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.51,0:09:42.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, this girl is—Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.51,0:09:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This girl is—You're Ozawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.15,0:09:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here? Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.19,0:09:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so, which girl in our\Nclass do you like, Itadori?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.03,0:10:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like any of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but if you had to pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.55,0:10:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if I had to pick, I guess... Ozawa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.69,0:10:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.99,0:10:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way, man, you're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's fat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.67,0:10:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.73,0:10:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's thoughtful and neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.51,0:10:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see it in the\Nway she eats and writes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.67,0:10:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's kind of cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you said you like\Ntall girls with big butts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's its own thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't compare apples to oranges\Nor even lychee to dragon fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.75,0:10:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's easy for girls to get fat. Girls
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.35,0:10:47.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when the human earth...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.57,0:10:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I started off as a fat cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that was my favorite part, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.55,0:10:53.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should totally make a\Nsequel where they bring Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.17,0:10:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Richter back for Human Earthworm 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:56.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, that'll be rad!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.47,0:10:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go see it again tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.25,0:11:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even I didn't have any interest in\Nchoosing someone who wouldn't choose me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori saw a side of\Nme I wasn't aware of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.19,0:11:23.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hated all the boys,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.17,0:11:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,except for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.37,0:11:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I thought maybe with\Nthe way I look now, I might.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.47,0:11:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,maybe, but look at me, living by the\Nsame standards as the people I hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.53,0:11:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.57,0:11:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.61,0:11:51.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.49,0:12:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't tell how it went they could\Nhave at least exchanged numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gave his cell number to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.79,0:12:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It should be okay
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.55,0:12:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, I've realized\Nmy own feelings, Fushiguro. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.85,0:12:23.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the thought that Itadori\Nmight land a girlfriend before
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.91,0:12:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm able to get a boyfriend\Nreally pisses me off to no end!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.71,0:12:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.05,0:12:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait. You need to\Nwalk behind me. Huh? You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.99,0:12:34.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.47,0:12:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you. Here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.25,0:12:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while you're at it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.57,0:12:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,While I'm at what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're the type of gentleman\Nwho'd feel bad making a lady carry them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.15,0:12:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.71,0:12:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:49.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The movie's starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go! Huh? Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.96,0:12:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get my stuff with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:56.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm\Nwatching some worm-o-man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.83,0:12:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fushiguro, you want some popcorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.39,0:12:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caramel flavor, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.67,0:13:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just don't tell me the plot\Nif we're gonna see worm-o-man.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.08,0:13:05.01,Main,Yuji,0,0,0,,{\an8}I told you all, it's {\i1}Human Earthworm 4{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.13,0:13:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:02.97,0:13:05.98,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 30\N{\fs30\fscy150}It's Like That
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:04.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Earthworm Man 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're only working\Nwith curse users, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.73,0:13:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to leave the investigation\Nof Kyoto up to you, Urahime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've heard from Gojo about\Nthe person leaking intel, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's probably two or more people\Nin contact with the curse users.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.95,0:13:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One would be a higher-up\Nwell above the principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.39,0:14:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to do\Nanything about that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other would be someone passing\Nthe information to that higher-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the one we're going to target.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're only a suspect at this point,\Nso we'll capture and interrogate them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.47,0:14:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, who from Kyoto is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That has to be the reason why they asked\Nthose of us from Tokyo to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kugisaki, you're awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.45,0:14:26.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name of the mole is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.49,0:14:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mekumaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.37,0:14:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.37,0:14:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today is the last day for\Nyou to turn in your notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.41,0:14:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makamaru?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Miwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to sleep for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.09,0:14:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, take my notebook.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.79,0:14:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on my desk. Going to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.93,0:14:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still only the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:14:59.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really did go to sleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.48,0:15:03.90,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(75,150)\pos(446,93.333)\fnComic Sans MS\b1\c&H6D46CB&\shad0\bord1\3c&H4C4383&}Poke Poke Poke
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder where the real\NMakamaru actually is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mechamaru's actual body, Kokichi\NMode, is in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.29,0:15:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, it's not like he's suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more that everyone else wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.39,0:15:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the process of elimination\Nleaves us with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.23,0:15:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mechamaru's technique\Nis puppet manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.61,0:15:38.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to his heavenly pact, he can\Nmanipulate puppets throughout all of Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.81,0:15:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if he has puppets we don't know about,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.05,0:15:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then it would be easy for him\Nto work as a mole if he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.03,0:15:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.94,0:15:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you miss a puppet\Nthat size being a mole?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.19,0:15:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By using puppets the size\Nof a fly or mosquito.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.65,0:15:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.61,0:15:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't think of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.61,0:15:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.15,0:16:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.31,0:16:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong... Rune?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.53,0:16:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knows that we're after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:26.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're certain that\Nthe mole is Mechamaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.61,0:16:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.52,0:16:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you forgot about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could we forget about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.03,0:16:43.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're personally familiar with\Nthe terrifying nature of a pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.63,0:16:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You always smell so moldy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.39,0:16:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And these are enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.39,0:16:51.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just kill him already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.31,0:16:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we can't kill him yet, Mahito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.09,0:16:57.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He agreed to cooperate with\Nus and provide information.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.27,0:17:02.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In exchange, we agreed to use your\Nidle transfiguration to fix his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.61,0:17:05.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the pact we all forged. Remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.35,0:17:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Killing him comes right after fixing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.45,0:17:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted him to do some\Nwork for us in Shibuya, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who broke\Nour pact first when you said
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we won't lay a hand on the\Npeople from the Kyoto School.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.31,0:17:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Konami's the one who did that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't blame us for what somebody else did.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.05,0:17:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't argue with cursed spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.39,0:17:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fix me, scumbag. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:39.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll get carried away and\Nturn him into a caterpillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.11,0:17:40.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mahito,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.02,0:17:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pacts that are forged with\Nothers are very different
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.07,0:17:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from the pacts that are\Nplaced upon oneself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first aspect of a break is the\Nuncertain nature of the penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.55,0:17:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you break a pact with yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.63,0:17:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whatever you were able\Nto gain in terms of the
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,improvement to your own\Nability is lost forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.61,0:18:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this time you can't break it,\Nbecause if you break this pact,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.63,0:18:06.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then we have no idea as to what kind\Nof disaster will eventually befall us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.75,0:18:08.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.77,0:18:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're actually lower than\Na scumbag, so be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.15,0:18:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idle Transfiguration.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.91,0:18:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no fun at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.45,0:18:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should celebrate a bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do that after I'm\Nfinished with my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.75,0:18:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:18:57.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.53,0:19:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we get started?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.01,0:19:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.35,0:19:13.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's my toy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.73,0:19:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He escaped?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like we needed\Nto kill him as part of our pact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.99,0:19:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pretty boring, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.25,0:19:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to have a match, not\Ngo hunting for him, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.83,0:20:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's more like it, Puppet Master!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.03,0:20:23.01,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,294)\bord3\shad0\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20}Ultimate Mechamaru, Mode: Absolute\N“Armored Puppet Ultimate Mechamaru Prototype 0”
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.23,0:20:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so you've been making something\Nlike this in secret the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes you had a reason to be a shut-in\Nafter all he's inside it right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.77,0:20:34.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he wouldn't want me to\Ntouch him after all the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.99,0:20:39.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cockpit, the seat of\Nhis soul, is the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Expansion rate normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:42.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perception feedback severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.51,0:20:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone lowered a veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.47,0:20:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.59,0:20:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not just attempting\Nto trap me inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cutting off my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't be as easy\Nas it was for Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.17,0:20:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.35,0:20:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My victory condition is Satoru Gojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to use any means necessary\Nto get in contact with Satoru.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and tell him about the Shibuya plot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.39,0:21:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I'll have him protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.49,0:21:12.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if I want to focus on\NCode, the one who lowered this veil,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.73,0:21:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mahito is too dangerous to ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.11,0:21:17.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to exorcise him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.63,0:21:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mind me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.43,0:21:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still at a disadvantage,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have a chance to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.59,0:21:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.65,0:21:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have all the time I was bound.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the cursed energy I\Ngained from that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.19,0:21:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't hold anything back.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.51,0:21:51.51,Sign_Basic,Counter,0,0,0,,{\fad(225,0)\an8\c&HF3FDF7&\3c&H54DCCD&\blur1\shad0}17 years 1 month 29 days
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.51,0:21:52.51,Sign_Basic,Counter,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H0500E4&\3c&H050707&\blur1\shad0}16 Years
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.83,0:21:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Charge! One year!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.69,0:21:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burn him now! Nikamaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.53,0:22:01.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold your cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.11,0:22:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.95,0:22:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.79,0:23:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to know what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.05,0:23:05.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll still believe my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.95,0:23:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.09,0:23:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.89,0:23:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.61,0:23:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can always be the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.15,0:23:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.25,0:23:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.16,0:23:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.49,0:23:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I decided I'd never tell anyone about\Nthe things I truly want to keep secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.79,0:23:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I wrote what type of boy I like\Nin my notebook back in grade school?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and let everyone find out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.61,0:23:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time, Evening Festival!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:48.80,0:23:55.01,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\bord2\blur4}Next Episode\N{\fs30\fscy150}Evening Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.41,0:23:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you write?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.71,0:23:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.65,0:23:54.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He does seem like he'd be fast.

